      <div type="clause" n="64">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 64</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Husbryce. Husbryce ⁊ bærnet ⁊ open ðyfð ⁊ æbere morþ ⁊ hlafordswice æfter woroldlage is botleas.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Assaults upon houses. According to secular law assaults upon houses, arson, theft which cannot be disproved, murder which cannot be denied and treachery towards a man's lord are crimes for which no compensation can be paid.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Husbryce ⁊ bærnet ⁊ open þyfð ⁊ æbǽre morð ⁊ hlafordswyce æfter woruldlage is botleas.</ab>
      </div>
